; The Polylith workspace manifest.
;
; The .fsproj graph is the dependency truth; `just poly-check` reconciles it
; with this list and enforces the component boundaries. The Clojure `poly` CLI
; is not required; `just` is the tool surface at first.
;
; :legacy lists what has not moved yet. Stage 2a moves the app to
; bases/scale-cli and adds the projects/scale publish target; stage 2b splits
; the Prelude, verification, demo, and development nodes.
{:vcs :git
 :top-ns "Scale"
 :components ["kernel" "core" "prelude" "ipc" "verification" "demo" "cli" "shell-host" "book-host" "nu-host" "adapter-c"]
 :bases ["scale-cli" "nu-game"]
 :projects ["scale" "game" "scale-tests"]
 :development []
 :external ["nu-engine"]
 :legacy []}
